1.  **Architecture Review**: Confirm the schema covers all current [Note](file:///c:/Users/USER/ACONCCInotesapp/types/note.ts#110-121) types and future scalability needs.
2.  **Performance Test**: Simulate 1000+ notes in the DB to ensure indexing works and the UI remains responsive.
3.  **Sync Simulation**: Verify the data structure can be serialized/deserialized for API calls.
